_paragraph\" >Atmospheric, dark audiovisual design that amplifies the sense of dread and isolation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the twelve patients has a unique message that you uncover during gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sanity loss system \u2013 the more you kill, the more you lose control over your own mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges that require both reflexes and difficult moral decisions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to face the challenge and hold on to the last remnants of your sanity? Remember, every move you make could mean your own end..</p>","developers":["RybonStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840750/5b8bb7c5bd2af40c6887b6fce787ddd5ef1e5abf/header.jpg?t=1757620389","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257177321,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257177321/movie480.mp4?t=1754165118","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257177321/movie_max.mp4?t=1754165118"},"name":"Trailer Twelve Mental Patients","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257177321/ed918f07d7e760d00f24d99ed7e8bac7c6fe57f3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754165118","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257177321/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1754165118","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257177321/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=